Object.assign(translations,{"原生 Cordis 记忆工具插件，支持显式保存与检索。已验证 DSH 0.2.1-rc.2 工具运行时；完整 Web / 桌面客户端启用尚未验证。": "Native Cordis memory tools for explicit saving and retrieval. Verified with the DSH 0.2.1-rc.2 tool runtime; full web and desktop client validation is pending.", "Codex 专用插件与 MCP 适配尚未实现，当前没有可执行的安装命令。": "A dedicated Codex plugin and MCP adapter are not available yet.", "在本项目根目录执行。插件不需要模型密钥；Harness 的模型由其自身配置。": "Run from the project root. The plugin needs no model key; configure the model in Harness.", "适用于已安装的 DSH 0.2.1-rc.2。以下为 PowerShell 命令，在本项目根目录运行；其他系统请传入插件目录的绝对路径。自定义 Profile 请替换 web。": "Requires DSH 0.2.1-rc.2. Run these PowerShell commands from the project root. On other systems, use the absolute plugin path. Replace web for a custom profile.", "将片段追加或合并到活动 Profile 的 cordis.patch.yml（通常为 ~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml，DSH_HOME 可更改根目录）。保留其他配置，然后重启 Harness。该插件面向单用户本地 Profile。": "Merge this into the active profile cordis.patch.yml (normally ~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml; DSH_HOME changes the root). Keep existing configuration and restart Harness. Designed for a single-user local profile.", "在 Harness 中发送以下请求，并确认当前 Agent 预设允许这两个工具。管理页可查看来源 deepseek_harness_plugin。候选或隐私拦截会如实返回。": "Send this request in Harness and allow both tools in the agent preset. Check the deepseek_harness_plugin source in Connections. Candidate and privacy outcomes are returned as recorded.", "已提供本地记忆工具插件，支持显式保存和检索，不替换内置记忆。适用于同机、单用户 Agent；尚未在真实客户端完成验证。": "Local tools support explicit saving and retrieval alongside built-in memory. Designed for a local single-user agent; real-client validation is pending.", "已提供原生目录式 Memory Provider，支持显式保存和检索。按活动 Profile 读取配置；不自动保存整段对话。尚未在真实客户端完成验证。": "A directory-based memory provider supports explicit saving and retrieval using the active profile. Full conversations are not saved automatically. Real-client validation is pending.", "在本项目根目录执行。OpenClaw 与服务需运行于同一环境。": "Run from the project root. OpenClaw and the service must share an environment.", "在本项目根目录执行；需要已安装 OpenClaw。按客户端提示审核本地插件源码。": "Run from the project root with OpenClaw installed. Review the local plugin source when prompted.", "将以下片段合并到已有 OpenClaw 配置。保留其他插件与 allow 列表；如有 allow 列表需追加 cognitive-memory。该用户空间由此单用户 Agent 独占。": "Merge into your OpenClaw configuration. Keep existing plugins and allow entries; add cognitive-memory to the allow list if present. This workspace belongs to the single-user agent.", "如有工具白名单，请允许 cognitive_memory_search 和 cognitive_memory_save。然后让 Agent 显式保存一条普通偏好并检索，核对管理页中的来源 openclaw_plugin。": "Allow cognitive_memory_search and cognitive_memory_save if tool restrictions are enabled. Save and retrieve a preference, then verify the openclaw_plugin source in Connections.", "在本项目根目录执行；Hermes 与服务需运行于同一环境。": "Run from the project root. Hermes and the service must share an environment.", "将路径替换为真实存在的活动 HERMES_HOME 目录。安装器保留已有配置；不会自动切换 Provider。": "Use the actual active HERMES_HOME directory. The installer preserves configuration and does not switch providers automatically.", "选择 cognitive-memory，确认地址和用户空间后重启 Hermes。只允许一个外部 Provider 生效。让 Agent 调用 cognitive_memory_save / cognitive_memory_search 验证，管理页来源为 hermes_plugin。": "Choose cognitive-memory, confirm the URL and workspace, then restart Hermes. Only one external provider can be active. Verify both memory tools and the hermes_plugin source in Connections.", "在已安装项目依赖的仓库根目录执行；当前工作台已连接时无需重复启动。": "Run from the repository root after installing dependencies. Skip this if the workspace is already connected.", "复制到 Python 运行；会向当前服务的用户空间写入一条示例记忆。": "Run in Python to write an example memory to the current service workspace.", "复制到 Python 运行；检索会记录访问与审计信息。": "Run in Python. Retrieval records access and audit information.", "在本项目根目录、目标 Python 虚拟环境中执行。当前使用仓库本地安装方式。": "Run in your target Python environment from the project root to install the local package.", "可在 Python 应用中直接调用，无需启动 HTTP 服务。示例使用独立数据库 integration_example.db，不与工作台数据库共享。": "Call directly from Python without the HTTP service. This example uses a separate integration_example.db database.", "示例用户：": "Example user:", "本地记忆插件": "Local memory plugin", "记忆插件 / MCP": "Memory plugin / MCP", "代码仅供复制，不会在页面自动执行。HTTP 地址跟随当前工作台：": "Examples are not executed automatically. Service URL:", "。用户 ID 用于区分数据空间，不提供身份认证。": ". User IDs separate workspaces; they do not provide authentication.", "部分完成": "Partially complete", "概念分类评测": "Concept classification evaluation", "当前空间": "Current workspace", "未命名会话": "Untitled conversation", "手动添加": "Manual entry", "暂无 Agent 记录": "No agent records yet", "没有符合条件的接入记录": "No matching connections", "正在同步接入信息…": "Syncing connections…", "来源客户端": "Source clients", "原子事实准确率": "Atomic fact accuracy", "无依据记忆拒认率": "Unsupported-memory rejection", "固定状态回答一致率": "Fixed-state response consistency", "同时冲突处置率": "Simultaneous conflict handling", "任务意图回应覆盖率": "Task intent coverage", "回答聚焦精确率": "Answer focus precision", "当前有效状态采用率": "Current valid state adoption", "条件保持曲线面积": "Conditional retention AUC", "准确性": "Accuracy", "一致性": "Consistency", "相关性": "Relevance", "时效性": "Currency", "保持性": "Retention", "长期记忆 · 六维评测": "Long-term memory · Six dimensions", "四类概念 · 存储策略": "Four memory types · Storage policy", "概念识别 · 基础检查": "Concept recognition · Basic validation", "记忆分类与过滤": "Memory classification and filtering", "记忆概念基础集": "Memory concept basics", "完整历史回放，检查事实回忆、冲突、更新与长期保持。": "Replay full histories to evaluate factual recall, conflicts, updates and retention.", "120 条记忆概念分类，30 条低价值输入的真实聊天过滤测试。": "120 concept classification cases and 30 conversational low-value filtering cases.", "四种记忆各 25 条生活化例子，检查分类边界。": "25 everyday examples for each memory type to test classification boundaries."});
Object.assign(translations,{"选择性记忆": "Selective memory", "可追溯管理": "Traceable memory", "从对话中，留下重要信息。": "Keep what matters from each conversation.", "偏好与事实通过编码门后进入记忆；临时闲聊不必都被长期保存。": "Preferences and facts enter memory after selective encoding. Casual chat need not become long-term memory.", "用户开始对话": "A conversation begins", "补充个人偏好": "A preference is shared", "检查信息与隐私条件": "Check information and privacy", "筛选值得保留的内容": "Select what matters", "形成一条长期记忆": "Create a lasting memory", "你好，今天有点忙。": "Hi, it has been a busy day.", "我喜欢用 Python 写脚本。": "I like writing scripts in Python.", "明确的工具偏好，可以作为记忆候选。": "A clear tool preference can become a memory candidate.", "偏好改变，记忆也随之更新。": "Preferences change. Memory evolves with them.", "新说法先进入候选区。当新的偏好得到更多一致信息的支持，更新当前状态，同时保留过去的偏好。": "New preferences start as candidates. Consistent evidence updates the current state while preserving its history.", "读取当前偏好": "Read the current preference", "收到不同的说法": "A different preference arrives", "新说法进入候选区": "Save the new statement as a candidate", "补充一致证据": "Gather consistent evidence", "新状态巩固，旧状态转为历史": "Consolidate the new state and preserve history", "我之前喜欢喝茶。": "You used to prefer tea.", "我现在更喜欢喝咖啡。": "I prefer coffee now.", "最近一直更喜欢喝咖啡。": "Coffee has been my preference lately.", "知道记住了什么，也知道为什么。": "Know what was remembered, and why.", "查看来源、状态和写入决策。遇到“不记忆”指令时停止保存，让每次变化都能在管理页找到依据。": "Explore sources, states and write decisions. Respect requests not to remember, with every change traceable in the workspace.", "用户表达长期偏好": "A lasting preference is shared", "定位本轮原文依据": "Locate supporting source text", "记忆关联来源与状态": "Link memory to its source and state", "收到不记忆指令": "Receive a request not to remember", "拦截本次写入，已有记忆保留": "Block this write and retain existing memories", "以后回答请简短一些。": "Please keep your answers brief.", "记录依据来自这条用户原话。": "This statement is the source of the memory.", "下一句话不要记住。": "Do not remember my next message.", "偏好 · 常用工具": "Preference · Tools", "当前记忆": "Current memory", "留下明确偏好，让后续对话更懂你": "Remember clear preferences for more personal conversations", "选择性编码": "Selective encoding", "等待有价值的信息": "Waiting for meaningful information", "检查写入条件…": "Checking retention rules…", "处理中": "Processing", "筛选值得长期保留的信息": "Select information worth remembering", "偏好 · 饮品": "Preference · Drinks", "更喜欢咖啡": "Prefers coffee", "喜欢喝茶": "Prefers tea", "已巩固": "Consolidated", "历史：喜欢喝茶": "Previously preferred tea", "候选：更喜欢咖啡 · 等待一致证据": "Candidate: prefers coffee · Awaiting evidence", "已有偏好保持有效": "The current preference remains valid", "偏好 · 回答方式": "Preference · Response style", "简短回答": "Brief answers", "新写入已拦截": "New write blocked", "来源可追溯": "Source linked", "提取原文依据": "Locate source evidence", "遵循不记忆指令，已有偏好不受影响": "Respect the request; existing preferences remain", "来源：用户原话 · 状态：当前": "Source: user statement · State: current", "记住偏好": "Remember a preference", "我喜欢喝茶。": "I like tea.", "一条偏好，有了自己的位置。": "A preference finds its place.", "信息通过编码门后，进入当前记忆。": "Accepted information becomes current memory.", "发现变化": "Notice a change", "出现新说法，先留作候选。": "Keep new statements as candidates.", "一次不同的表达，不立即覆盖已有偏好。": "One different statement does not replace an existing preference.", "证据巩固": "Consolidate evidence", "证据充分后，更新当前状态。": "Update the current state when evidence supports it.", "新的偏好得到确认，过去的偏好保留为历史。": "Confirm the new preference and keep the previous one in history.", "我喜欢什么？": "What do I like?", "我喜欢喝茶": "I like tea"});
